{
 "schema": "anim.bake_order/1",
 "_about": "The bake's order and what a slice may start (docs/animation/bake-pace.md; AnimData.bake_pending, _queue): `first` is the poses a fight asks for: the dear ones (1 ms and over, in the order a fight asks for them: six seeded AI matches, then the nine cells' poses by use) and then the cheap ones in the same order, so the queue bakes them before the rest, the dear ones in the first frames (the intro) and the cheap ones in slices that cannot overshoot, and a pose is rarely baked on the spot; `cost` is the microseconds each pose takes to bake on this PC, quiet (the minimum of three runs, to 100), so a slice does not start a pose that would take it past its budget. Only the order and the pace change: every pose is baked from the same sketch. Render only, outside the sim's data hash.",
